activity Fund Transfer Initiate
activity Transfer Request Validate
activity Transfer Approve
activity Transfer Execute
activity Transfer Report Generate
activity Transfer Report Review
activity Stakeholders Notify
activity Accounts Reconcile
activity Transfer Process Close
bind Fund Transfer Initiate: ID Transfer, Amount Transfer, Type Account
bind Transfer Request Validate: ID Transfer, Status Transfer, ID Validator
bind Transfer Approve: ID Transfer, ID Approver
bind Transfer Execute: ID Transfer
bind Transfer Report Generate: ID Transfer
bind Transfer Report Review: ID Transfer, Level Discrepancy, ID Reviewer
bind Stakeholders Notify: ID Transfer, Method Notification
bind Accounts Reconcile: ID Transfer
bind Transfer Process Close: ID Transfer
ID Transfer: integer between 1 and 999999
Amount Transfer: float between 0.01 and 1000000.0
Status Transfer: Pending, Validated, Approved, Completed, Rejected
Type Account: Checking, Savings, Business
ID Validator: integer between 1 and 9999
ID Approver: integer between 1 and 9999
Method Notification: Email, SMS, Push Notification
Level Discrepancy: Low, Medium, High
ID Reviewer: integer between 1 and 9999
Init[Fund Transfer Initiate] | |
Chain Succession[Fund Transfer Initiate, Transfer Request Validate] | | |
Chain Succession[Transfer Request Validate, Transfer Approve] | | |
Chain Succession[Transfer Approve, Transfer Execute] | | |0,2,h
Chain Succession[Transfer Execute, Transfer Report Generate] | | |
Chain Succession[Transfer Report Generate, Transfer Report Review] | | |
Chain Succession[Transfer Report Review, Stakeholders Notify] | | |0,1,h
Chain Succession[Stakeholders Notify, Accounts Reconcile] | | |
Chain Succession[Accounts Reconcile, Transfer Process Close] | | |
End[Transfer Process Close] | |